  "text": "Frustrated with pharmacy substitution alerts and out of stock messaging\n\nI am completely fed up with how the system handles out-of-stock medication notifications. Every time I try to switch a patient's prescription to an alternative therapeutic agent because the local pharmacy is out, the software loops me back to the original drug profile instead of saving the substitution. I spent twenty minutes this afternoon clicking through pharmacy messaging prompts for a patient, only for the interface to clear my notes and force me to start the electronic prescribing sequence all over again. This is wasting a massive amount of clinical time during our busy afternoon hours, and I need to know why the substitution workflow is malfunctioning so badly right now."
 },
